---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13015550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(301) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Gas Furnace Repair Laurel MD | Same-Day Service" description="Expert gas furnace repair in Laurel, MD. Igniters, flame sensors, gas valves, and more. Licensed, same-day service.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Gas Furnace Repair in Laurel, MD</h1>
      <p>Traditional gas furnaces power most Laurel homes. When they fail, we diagnose accurately and repair with quality parts.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.25rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get a Quote — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Gas Furnace Experts</h2>
      <p>Most homes in Laurel and Prince George's County rely on natural gas furnaces. These units are reliable but develop predictable failure points: hot surface igniters, flame sensors, gas valves, pressure switches, and inducer motors.</p>
      <h3>Repairs We Perform Daily</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Igniter replacement</strong> — the most common no-heat cause on modern gas furnaces</li>
        <li><strong>Flame sensor cleaning &amp; replacement</strong> — dirty sensors cause repeated lockouts</li>
        <li><strong>Gas valve &amp; pressure switch service</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Inducer motor &amp; draft issues</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Control board diagnostics</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Blower motor &amp; capacitor service</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <p>We service all major brands including Carrier, Trane, Lennox, Rheem, Goodman, York, and American Standard.</p>
      <p><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Gas Furnace Repair</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
